The capital city of [[Geography/Althane/Salores/index|Salores]], and the bulwark that bears a large brunt of the incoming [[Phenomena/Althane/Tidal|Tidal]]. The city is easily seen from miles away due to the mile-high, spiked bulwarks that face the coast.
